===Format===
*Page Playoff Bracket.
**5th and 6th start against each other in the Lower Bracket with 3rd and 4th in the Upper Bracket, playing a Double Elimination Bracket.
**The rest stands as a Single Elimination Bracket.
***All matches are a {{Abbr/Bo3}} set for a {{abbr/Bo5}} (First to win 2 {{Abbr/Bo5}} series) except the Semifinals and Grand Finals, which are a {{Abbr/Bo3}} set for a {{abbr/Bo7}} (First to win 2 {{Abbr/Bo7}} series).

